  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Water Tracker</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"app-title\">\n    <h1 id=\"app-title\">Pixel Water Tracker</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Stay hydrated, one glass at a time.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"glass-display\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n      <span id=\"glass-count\">0</span> / <span id=\"glass-goal\">8</span> glasses\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"progress-container\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"8\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-label=\"Water intake progress\">\n      <div id=\"progress-bar\" class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 0%;\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"remove-btn\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Remove one glass\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"add-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" aria-label=\"Add one glass\">+</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <p id=\"goal-message\" class=\"goal-message\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #0f172a;\n  --card-bg: #1e293b;\n  --primary: #38bdf8;\n  --primary-hover: #7dd3fc;\n  --primary-pressed: #0ea5e9;\n  --text: #f1f5f9;\n  --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n  --success: #4ade80;\n  --border: #334155;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n  color: var(--primary);\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.glass-display {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n#glass-count {\n  color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.progress-container {\n  background: #0f172a;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  height: 28px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.progress-bar {\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), #22d3ee);\n  transition: width 0.3s ease;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  width: 64px;\n  height: 64px;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #334155;\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, border-color 0.15s;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #475569;\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--primary);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n  background: var(--primary-pressed);\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: #0f172a;\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  background: var(--primary-hover);\n  border-color: var(--primary-hover);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:active {\n  background: var(--primary-pressed);\n}\n\n.btn:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.goal-message {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  min-height: 1.6em;\n  color: var(--success);\n  transition: opacity 0.3s;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n  .glass-display {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    width: 56px;\n    height: 56px;\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var GOAL = 8;\n  var count = 0;\n\n  var countEl = document.getElementById('glass-count');\n  var goalEl = document.getElementById('glass-goal');\n  var progressBar = document.getElementById('progress-bar');\n  var progressContainer = document.querySelector('.progress-container');\n  var addBtn = document.getElementById('add-btn');\n  var removeBtn = document.getElementById('remove-btn');\n  var messageEl = document.getElementById('goal-message');\n\n  goalEl.textContent = GOAL;\n\n  function update() {\n    countEl.textContent = count;\n    var pct = Math.min((count / GOAL) * 100, 100);\n    progressBar.style.width = pct + '%';\n    progressContainer.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', count);\n    progressContainer.setAttribute('aria-valuemax', GOAL);\n\n    if (count >= GOAL) {\n      messageEl.textContent = '🎉 Goal reached! Great job staying hydrated!';\n    } else if (count === GOAL - 1) {\n      messageEl.textContent = 'Almost there! One more glass to go.';\n    } else {\n      messageEl.textContent = '';\n    }\n\n    removeBtn.disabled = count <= 0;\n    addBtn.disabled = count >= GOAL;\n  }\n\n  addBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (count < GOAL) {\n      count++;\n      update();\n    }\n  });\n\n  removeBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (count > 0) {\n      count--;\n      update();\n    }\n  });\n\n  update();\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Water Intake Tracker\n\nA fully offline, accessible browser app that helps you track your daily water intake in glasses.\n\n## Features\n\n- Daily goal of 8 glasses (default)\n- Add or remove glasses with labeled buttons\n- Visual progress bar toward the goal\n- Celebration message when the goal is reached\n- Keyboard-accessible controls with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout that works from 360px wide\n- Cohesive dark palette with pixel-inspired styling\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Edge).\n2. Click the **+** button (or press Enter/Space when focused) to add a glass.\n3. Click the **−** button to remove a glass.\n4. Watch the progress bar fill and see the message when you reach 8 glasses.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have `aria-label` attributes for screen readers.\n- Progress bar uses `role=\"progressbar\"` with live `aria-valuenow` updates.\n- Goal message uses `role=\"status\"` and `aria-live=\"polite\"`.\n- All controls are reachable via Tab and have visible focus outlines.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No external assets, packages, network requests, or server code.\n- Only HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n- No inline event handlers.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and content\n- `styles.css` — theming, layout, and responsive design\n- `app.js` — state management and event handling\n- `README.md` — this file",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}